<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>태권도 용어 (跆拳道 用語) — AI 태권도 용어 발음 코치</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@400;500;700;900&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700&family=Noto+Sans+Arabic:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: #10161F;
    --bg-soft: #161D28;
    --surface: #1C2531;
    --surface-hi: #242F3D;
    --line: #2E3A49;
    --text: #F2EFE7;
    --text-dim: #9AA6B2;
    --gold: #D4A72C;
    --gold-soft: #8A742A;
    --red: #C1443C;
    --green: #4C8C5C;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, rgba(212,167,44,0.06), transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 90%, rgba(62,111,166,0.07), transparent 45%);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', 'Noto Sans SC', 'Noto Sans Arabic', sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .wrap { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 80px; }

  /* bidirectional isolate for translated text (Arabic/Persian render RTL automatically) */
  bdi { unicode-bidi: isolate; }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  header { margin-bottom: 44px; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 22px; height: 1px;
    background: var(--gold);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 54px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  h1 span { color: var(--gold); }
  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 16px;
    max-width: 600px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ---------- Language switch ---------- */
  .lang-switch {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 4px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .lang-btn {
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .lang-btn.active { background: var(--gold); color: #14100A; font-weight: 600; }
  .lang-btn:hover:not(.active) { color: var(--text); }

  /* ---------- Term picker ---------- */
  .browser-note {
    margin-top: 18px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--gold);
    background: rgba(212,167,44,0.08);
    border: 1px solid var(--gold-soft);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin: 40px 0 16px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .category-block { margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .category-title {
    font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .category-title bdi {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', 'Noto Sans SC', 'Noto Sans Arabic', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .term-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .term-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .term-card:hover { border-color: var(--gold-soft); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .term-card.active {
    background: var(--surface-hi);
    border-color: var(--gold);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold) inset;
  }
  .term-card-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .speak-btn {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    color: var(--gold);
    border-radius: 8px;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .speak-btn:hover { background: rgba(212,167,44,0.15); border-color: var(--gold-soft); }
  .speak-btn:active { transform: scale(0.92); }
  .speak-btn.speaking { color: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); animation: pulse 1.1s infinite; }
  .speak-btn-lg {
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--gold);
    border-radius: 10px;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    font-size: 18px;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .speak-btn-lg:hover { background: rgba(212,167,44,0.12); }
  .speak-btn-lg:active { transform: scale(0.94); }
  .speak-btn-lg.speaking { color: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); animation: pulse 1.1s infinite; }
  .target-audio-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .listen-hint {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .term-hangul {
    font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  .term-romaja {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .term-gloss {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* ---------- Practice panel ---------- */
  .practice {
    margin-top: 40px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 36px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    gap: 36px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .practice { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 24px; }
  }

  /* Score meter (signature element) */
  .score-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .score-ring { position: relative; width: 160px; height: 160px; }
  .score-ring svg { transform: rotate(-90deg); }
  .score-ring-center {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .score-num {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .score-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .score-tag {
    font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  /* Right column: interaction */
  .practice-main { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
  .target-block .term-hangul { font-size: 38px; }
  .target-meta {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .target-meaning { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 6px; }

  .mic-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
  .mic-btn {
    width: 64px; height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--gold);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .mic-btn:hover { background: rgba(212,167,44,0.1); }
  .mic-btn.listening {
    background: var(--red);
    border-color: var(--red);
    color: var(--text);
    animation: pulse 1.1s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(193,68,60,0.5); }
    70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 14px rgba(193,68,60,0); }
    100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(193,68,60,0); }
  }
  .mic-status {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .heard-block {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    min-height: 24px;
    font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .heard-label {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .feedback-block {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
    padding: 4px 0 4px 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
    min-height: 20px;
  }
  .feedback-block.loading { color: var(--text-dim); font-style: italic; }

  .empty-note {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 40px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 18px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow">AI Pronunciation Coach for Foreign Practitioners</div>
    <h1>태권도 용어<span>(跆拳道 用語)</span></h1>
    <div class="subtitle" id="subtitleText">
      전 세계에서 우리말로 수련되는 태권도의 고귀한 문화적 가치를 올바르게 보존하고자 합니다. 이를 위해 누구나 태권도 용어를 쉽게 익힐 수 있는 AI 발음 교정 프로그램을 제작했습니다. 사용자가 예시를 듣고 따라 발음하면 인공지능이 정확도를 정밀하게 채점하여 맞춤형 코칭을 제공합니다.
    </div>
    <div class="lang-switch" id="langSwitch">
      <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="ko">한국어</button>
      <button class="lang-btn active" data-lang="en">EN</button>
      <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="es">ES</button>
      <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="fr">FR</button>
      <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="zh">中文</button>
      <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="fa">فارسی</button>
      <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="ar">العربية</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="browser-note" id="browserNote"></div>

  <div class="section-label" id="sectionLabel">용어 선택 (SELECT A TERM)</div>
  <div id="termCategories"></div>

  <div class="practice">
    <div class="score-wrap">
      <div class="score-ring">
        <svg width="160" height="160" viewBox="0 0 160 160">
          <circle cx="80" cy="80" r="70" fill="none" stroke="#2E3A49" stroke-width="9"/>
          <circle id="ringProgress" cx="80" cy="80" r="70" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)"
                  stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-dasharray="440" stroke-dashoffset="440"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="score-ring-center">
          <div class="score-num" id="scoreNum">—</div>
          <div class="score-label" id="scoreLabel">정확도</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="score-tag" id="scoreTag">발음을 시도해 보세요</div>
    </div>

    <div class="practice-main">
      <div class="target-block">
        <div class="target-audio-row">
          <div class="term-hangul" id="targetHangul">차렷</div>
          <button class="speak-btn-lg" id="targetSpeakBtn" title="발음 듣기">🔊</button>
        </div>
        <div class="target-meta" id="targetMeta">Charyeot</div>
        <div class="target-meaning" id="targetMeaning">발차기 전 부동자세를 명하는 구령</div>
        <div class="listen-hint" id="listenHint">스피커를 눌러 발음을 들어보세요</div>
      </div>

      <div class="mic-row">
        <button class="mic-btn" id="micBtn" title="마이크로 발음하기">🎤</button>
        <div class="mic-status" id="micStatus">버튼을 눌러 발음을 녹음하세요</div>
      </div>

      <div class="heard-block">
        <span class="heard-label" id="heardLabel">AI가 인식한 발음</span>
        <span id="heardText" class="empty-note">아직 시도하지 않았습니다</span>
      </div>

      <div class="feedback-block" id="feedbackBlock">
        <span class="empty-note">발음을 시도하면 AI 코치의 피드백이 여기에 표시됩니다.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <span id="footerText"></span>
  </footer>

</div>

